  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1156/586/create_stuff_title_final-png.png\" width=\"1673\" height=\"592\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FurtiTwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/985/youtube-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3fGJwJqzu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/987/discord-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffurtitwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/988/donate-png.png\" width=\"22%\" height=\"22%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furti_two/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/986/curseforge-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ffurti-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/984/modrinth-png.png\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">「Create 物品与装饰」（Create Stuff 'N Additions）是一款利用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">机械动力</a>资源打造的模组，为你带来全新的装备、工具和小装置！这些装备不仅能提升你的物理能力（如力量或挖掘速度），还能赋予你移动的新方式——漂浮、弹跳，甚至飞行！不同材质的装备（黄铜、安山岩或铜）需要不同的燃料，例如蒸汽（使用水和燃料）、热能（使用燃料）或液压能（使用水）。此外，该模组还添加了许多新配方，让你能利用机械动力新增的“幽魂灌注”和“流体填充”等机制，来制作原本无法合成的游戏物品（锁链盔甲、珊瑚、下界岩、哭泣黑曜石和岩浆膏等）。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>该模组最初是为法国 Minecraft 服务器“机械生命”而制作的。</strong>采用 Hybrid Mcreator 工具开发。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ueNNUy6enNE?si=wx5D5bbB-RDCxuIL\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LAP-V3GiwYM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pKb8vEXkRW8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>计划中的功能</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>- 手动无人机（安山岩无人机）</p>\n<p>- 可编程无人机（黄铜无人机）</p>\n<p>- 载具创造标签页</p>\n<p>- 潜艇</p>\n<p>- 轻便摩托车</p>\n<p>- 配置文件</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>你可以将 Create Stuff Additions 放入你的整合包中。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>旧版描述（v2.0.0 之前）：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>⛽为你的物品添加燃料：将物品放在副手（例如选中物品后按F键），然后将燃料放在主手（如煤炭、木头等），按Q键丢出即可。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>新工具：</strong></p>\n<p><br>喷嘴风扇（推开周围实体，可偏转箭矢）、烈焰喷射器（喷火）、黄铜便携钻头（多功能工具，挖掘极快但无法附魔）、绳索钩爪（仅 1.18.2 版本）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/762198215264305182/890573227523448903/V5ZLu01wLXAtcC1wLXAtcC1wLXAtcC1wLXAtcC1wLXAtcC1wLXAtcCn9cCZhD6gpif1wmuZtcC1wLXAtcC1wLXAtcC1wLXAtcC1w.png?ex=6a4262f3&amp;is=6a411173&amp;hm=fd7d37b61635e8203e972a343a0db531b4217174dc9fa8dfef9f06ad72b38874&amp;\" width=\"1357\" height=\"483\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pvgL6kiceII?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><br><strong>新旧机械动力工具：</strong></p>\n<p><br>铜工具、锌工具和黄铜工具<br>烈焰工具：击碎方块时会熔化（石头→平滑石头、花岗岩→辉长岩、原木→木炭等），攻击生物时会点燃目标。（需使用搅拌器制作）<br>镀金石英工具：效率高于钻石，攻击力弱但攻击速度快。（需使用机械合成器制作）<br>暗影钢工具（1.18.2 版本为经验工具）：挖掘等级与铁相同，但挖掘速度高于金工具。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/633/image_2026-06-28_190603107-png.png\" width=\"1037\" height=\"362\"><br><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>黄铜喷气背包与黄铜外骨骼：<br></strong></span><br>喷气背包可让你飞行。黄铜外骨骼是一件盔甲，可为你提供力量或急迫效果。（需使用机械合成器制作）<br>它们需要燃料（补充燃料时，将物品放在副手，然后丢出煤炭、烈焰棒或木头等燃料）<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/634/image_2026-06-28_190613334-png.png\" width=\"2334\" height=\"1700\"><br><br></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">铜、锌、黄铜盔甲与黄铜轻便摩托车：</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/635/image_2026-06-28_190631737-png.png\" width=\"2040\" height=\"966\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>其他物品：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/636/image_2026-06-28_190648706-png.png\" width=\"1153\" height=\"336\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">你还可以看看我的其他模组：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useless-sword\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/416/64/64/637746702745178325.png\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/items-to-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1070/646/64/64/638606054091700999.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/588/64/64/637853847063684188.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/657/638184557398425576.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/organics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/413/64/64/637746699816017646.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slimy-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1076/873/64/64/638614825744489631.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/724/578/64/64/638077506455486007.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frosted-friends\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/411/64/64/637746696852738455.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wandering-bags\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/689/759/64/64/638069994452394564.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-torpedoes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/674/64/64/638476410476119618.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/depth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/720/638184653709126308.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-of-yucutan\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1002/886/64/64/638523299285638581.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/779/326/64/64/638124003553252444.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sons-of-sins\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/109/sons_of_sins_logo_bis.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-confectionery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/246/64/64/637852985411120756.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/608/519/64/64/637987931627550518.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-logistics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1116/69/64/64/638670333200272317.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-weight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/734/378/64/64/638084439152506136.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamo\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/774/64/64/638476553282271633.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ninjaxxs-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/549/392/64/64/637886561525247638.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fuzes-relics\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/580/980/64/64/637945482784615684.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
